   AND (aw.side_id, aw.role, aw.role_en, aw.sources) IS DISTINCT FROM ((SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'pays-arabes'), 'Le Su-7 combat dans les rangs égyptiens, mais le premier lot livré, quatorze appareils, est détruit pendant la guerre, essentiellement par les frappes de *Moked* sur les aérodromes. La Syrie ne reçoit les siens qu''après le conflit.', 'The Su-7 fought with the Egyptian air force, but the first batch delivered, fourteen aircraft, was destroyed during the war, mostly by the *Moked* strikes on the airfields. Syria only received its own after the conflict.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sukhoi_Su-7
