En août, les pertes continuent : deux MiG-29 (dont l’un par un Bouk le 7), un Su-24M le 20 et un Su-25 pendant la bataille d’Ilovaïsk le 29 sont abattus. Selon l’article de Wikipédia consacré à l’armée de l’air ukrainienne, les quatre premiers mois de guerre coûtent à l’aviation et à l’aviation de l’armée de terre six Su-25, trois avions de transport, quatre avions d’attaque ou de chasse, quatre Mi-24 et deux Mi-8 ; 51 aviateurs, dont 16 pilotes, sont tués de février à début septembre 2014.

Après le cessez-le-feu de septembre 2014, Moscou ayant exigé l’interdiction de toute action aérienne ukrainienne, l’aviation de Kyiv cesse de combattre au-dessus du Donbass : la guerre devient purement terrestre. Le ciel du front appartient désormais aux drones : l’armée russe fait voler des drones Forpost, dont plusieurs sont abattus jusqu’en 2016, et les États-Unis livrent en juillet 2016 des mini-drones RQ-11 Raven, vite délaissés parce que leur liaison analogique se brouille et s’intercepte aisément.', 'The Ukrainian Air Force entered the war badly weakened: down to 144 aircraft, only two-thirds of them airworthy, it had just lost its Crimean bases. From April 2014, MiG-29s patrolled over the Donbas and flew repeated shows of force. On 26 May, rocket-firing Su-25s supported the Mi-24 helicopters that retook Donetsk airport from the separatists. Throughout the summer, Su-25s, Su-24Ms and MiG-29s struck separatist positions, while An-26 and Il-76 transports carried troops and equipment and the An-30 photographed the ground.

The response came from the ground. The separatists shot down five helicopters in May and June, then the An-30B reconnaissance aircraft over Sloviansk on 6 June (five killed). On 14 June an Il-76MD approaching Luhansk was destroyed by Igla shoulder-launched missiles with its nine crew and 40 paratroopers, the Ukrainian military''s heaviest single loss since the conflict began. In July the fire reached higher: on the 14th an An-26 was shot down at 6,500 m, beyond the reach of shoulder-launched missiles, and Kyiv blamed a missile fired from Russia; on the 16th a Su-25 went down near Amvrosiivka, according to Kyiv to a missile from a Russian MiG-29, which Moscow denied; on the 23rd two more Su-25s were downed over Savur-Mohyla.

On 17 July 2014 a Buk surface-to-air missile destroyed the Malaysia Airlines Flight 17 Boeing 777 (Amsterdam to Kuala Lumpur) over separatist-held territory, killing all 298 people on board. The Dutch-led joint investigation team traced the launcher to Russia''s 53rd Anti-Aircraft Missile Brigade; investigators dismissed the Russian claim that a Ukrainian Su-25, which could not even reach the airliner''s cruising altitude, had shot it down. A Dutch court convicted three men in absentia on 17 November 2022, and the International Civil Aviation Organization held Russia responsible in May 2025.

In August the losses went on: two MiG-29s (one by a Buk on the 7th), a Su-24M on the 20th and a Su-25 during the battle of Ilovaisk on the 29th were shot down. According to the English Wikipedia article on the Ukrainian Air Force, the first four months of the war cost the air force and army aviation six Su-25s, three transport aircraft, four strike or air-superiority fighters, four Mi-24s and two Mi-8s; 51 airmen, including 16 pilots, were killed between February and early September 2014.

After the September 2014 ceasefire, with Moscow demanding a ban on any Ukrainian air activity, Kyiv''s aviation stopped fighting over the Donbas and the war became a purely ground affair. The sky over the front now belonged to drones: the Russian army flew Forpost drones, several of which were shot down up to 2016, and in July 2016 the United States delivered RQ-11 Raven mini-drones, soon sidelined because their analogue link was easily jammed and intercepted.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/War_in_Donbas
https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guerre_du_Donbass
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukrainian_Air_Force
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_aviation_shootdowns_and_accidents_during_the_Russo-Ukrainian_war
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malaysia_Airlines_Flight_17
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Battle_of_Donetsk_Airport
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2014_Ukrainian_Air_Force_Ilyushin_Il-76_shootdown');
INSERT INTO war_sides (war_id, side_key, position, name, name_en, members, members_en)
SELECT w.id, 'ukraine', 1, 'Ukraine', 'Ukraine', 'Forces armées ukrainiennes (armée de l’air, aviation de l’armée de terre) et bataillons de volontaires, avec du matériel non létal fourni par les États-Unis', 'Ukrainian Armed Forces (air force, army aviation) and volunteer battalions, with non-lethal equipment supplied by the United States' FROM wars w WHERE w.name = 'Guerre du Donbass'
ON CONFLICT ON CONSTRAINT uq_war_sides_key DO UPDATE
   SET position = EXCLUDED.position, name = EXCLUDED.name, name_en = EXCLUDED.name_en,
       members = EXCLUDED.members, members_en = EXCLUDED.members_en
 WHERE (war_sides.position, war_sides.name, war_sides.name_en, war_sides.members, war_sides.members_en)
       IS DISTINCT FROM (EXCLUDED.position, EXCLUDED.name, EXCLUDED.name_en, EXCLUDED.members, EXCLUDED.members_en);
INSERT INTO war_sides (war_id, side_key, position, name, name_en, members, members_en)
SELECT w.id, 'separatistes-russie', 2, 'Séparatistes et Russie', 'Separatists and Russia', '« Républiques populaires » autoproclamées de Donetsk (RPD) et de Louhansk (RPL) ; Russie (troupes, matériel et défense antiaérienne, engagement nié par Moscou)', 'Self-proclaimed Donetsk (DPR) and Luhansk (LPR) "people''s republics"; Russia (troops, equipment and air defences, involvement denied by Moscow)' FROM wars w WHERE w.name = 'Guerre du Donbass'
ON CONFLICT ON CONSTRAINT uq_war_sides_key DO UPDATE
   SET position = EXCLUDED.position, name = EXCLUDED.name, name_en = EXCLUDED.name_en,
       members = EXCLUDED.members, members_en = EXCLUDED.members_en
 WHERE (war_sides.position, war_sides.name, war_sides.name_en, war_sides.members, war_sides.members_en)
       IS DISTINCT FROM (EXCLUDED.position, EXCLUDED.name, EXCLUDED.name_en, EXCLUDED.members, EXCLUDED.members_en);
DELETE FROM war_sides s USING wars w
 WHERE s.war_id = w.id AND w.name = 'Guerre du Donbass' AND s.side_key NOT IN ('ukraine', 'separatistes-russie');
UPDATE airplane_wars aw SET side_id = (SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'ukraine'), role = 'Promis en mars 2015, 72 mini-drones Raven livrés par les États-Unis arrivent le 27 juillet 2016 pour surveiller le front. Leur liaison analogique, aisément brouillée et interceptée, déçoit : fin 2016, l’armée ukrainienne ne les emploie plus en première ligne.', role_en = 'Promised in March 2015, 72 US-supplied Raven mini-drones arrived on 27 July 2016 to watch the front. Their analogue link, easily jammed and intercepted, disappointed: by late 2016 the Ukrainian army had stopped using them on the front line.', sources = 'https://www.armyrecognition.com/archives/archives-land-defense/land-defense-2016/ukraine-armed-forces-take-delivery-of-24-rq-11b-raven-b-uavs-from-united-states-12907161
https://www.twz.com/8921/america-is-still-training-ukrainian-troops-to-fly-a-drone-they-hate'
  FROM airplanes a, wars w
 WHERE aw.id_airplane = a.id AND aw.id_wars = w.id AND a.name = 'AeroVironment RQ-11 Raven' AND w.name = 'Guerre du Donbass'
   AND (aw.side_id, aw.role, aw.role_en, aw.sources) IS DISTINCT FROM ((SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'ukraine'), 'Promis en mars 2015, 72 mini-drones Raven livrés par les États-Unis arrivent le 27 juillet 2016 pour surveiller le front. Leur liaison analogique, aisément brouillée et interceptée, déçoit : fin 2016, l’armée ukrainienne ne les emploie plus en première ligne.', 'Promised in March 2015, 72 US-supplied Raven mini-drones arrived on 27 July 2016 to watch the front. Their analogue link, easily jammed and intercepted, disappointed: by late 2016 the Ukrainian army had stopped using them on the front line.', 'https://www.armyrecognition.com/archives/archives-land-defense/land-defense-2016/ukraine-armed-forces-take-delivery-of-24-rq-11b-raven-b-uavs-from-united-states-12907161
https://www.twz.com/8921/america-is-still-training-ukrainian-troops-to-fly-a-drone-they-hate');
