https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amiriyah_shelter_bombing'
  FROM airplanes a, wars w
 WHERE aw.id_airplane = a.id AND aw.id_wars = w.id AND a.name = 'F-117 Nighthawk' AND w.name = 'Guerre du Golfe'
   AND (aw.side_id, aw.role, aw.role_en, aw.sources) IS DISTINCT FROM ((SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'coalition'), 'Dès 3 heures le 17 janvier, dix F-117 frappent Bagdad, protégés par les EF-111. Ils effectuent environ 1 300 sorties sans aucune perte et visent les cibles les plus défendues ; le 13 février, deux d''entre eux détruisent l''abri d''Amiriyah, tuant au moins 408 civils.', 'At 3:00 a.m. on 17 January ten F-117s struck Baghdad, covered by EF-111s. They flew some 1,300 sorties without a single loss against the most heavily defended targets; on 13 February two of them destroyed the Amiriyah shelter, killing at least 408 civilians.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lockheed_F-117_Nighthawk
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gulf_War_air_campaign
