 WHERE aw.id_airplane = a.id AND aw.id_wars = w.id AND a.name = 'Su-24' AND w.name = 'Guerres de Tchétchénie'
   AND (aw.side_id, aw.role, aw.role_en, aw.sources) IS DISTINCT FROM ((SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'russie'), 'Seul capable de bombarder au radar par mauvais temps, le Su-24 frappe en 1994-1995 les ponts de l’Argoun et des cibles dans Grozny ; des Su-24MR assurent la reconnaissance. En 1999, il bombarde Elistanji à la bombe à sous-munitions ; un Su-24 est abattu près de Grozny en octobre.', 'The only aircraft able to bomb by radar in bad weather, the Su-24 hit the Argun bridges and targets in Grozny in 1994-1995, while Su-24MRs flew reconnaissance. In 1999 it dropped cluster bombs on Elistanzhi; one Su-24 was shot down near Grozny in October.', 'https://web.archive.org/web/20130517020721/http://mashar.free.fr/mil_avi.htm
https://www.raf.mod.uk/what-we-do/centre-for-air-and-space-power-studies/aspr/apr-vol4-iss4-2-pdf/
