https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princess_Olga_Pskov_International_Airport
https://www.oryxspioenkop.com/2022/02/attack-on-europe-documenting-ukrainian.html'
  FROM airplanes a, wars w
 WHERE aw.id_airplane = a.id AND aw.id_wars = w.id AND a.name = 'Iliouchine Il-76' AND w.name = 'Invasion russe de l''Ukraine'
   AND (aw.side_id, aw.role, aw.role_en, aw.sources) IS DISTINCT FROM (NULL::int, 'Dix-huit Il-76 russes chargés de renforts ne peuvent se poser à Hostomel le 24 février 2022 ; quatre sont touchés par des drones à Pskov en août 2023. Côté ukrainien, deux Il-76 de la 25e brigade de transport sont détruits au sol à Melitopol.', 'Eighteen Russian Il-76s carrying reinforcements could not land at Hostomel on 24 February 2022; four were hit by drones at Pskov in August 2023. On the Ukrainian side, two Il-76s of the 25th Transport Brigade were destroyed on the ground at Melitopol.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilyushin_Il-76
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Antonov_Airport
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princess_Olga_Pskov_International_Airport
https://www.oryxspioenkop.com/2022/02/attack-on-europe-documenting-ukrainian.html');
UPDATE airplane_wars aw SET side_id = (SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'russie'), role = 'Ravitailleur de l’aviation à long rayon d’action russe, basé notamment à Diaguilevo, qui « abrite des ravitailleurs soutenant les frappes de missiles » selon l’état-major ukrainien. Le 5 novembre 2026, un média ukrainien affirme qu’un Il-78 y a été endommagé par des drones.', role_en = 'Tanker of Russia’s long-range aviation, based notably at Dyagilevo, which "hosts aerial refuelling aircraft supporting missile strikes" according to the Ukrainian General Staff. On 5 November 2026 Ukrainian media claimed an Il-78 was damaged there by drones.', sources = 'https://www.ukrinform.net/rubric-ato/4001358-ukrainian-forces-strike-russian-airfields-engels-and-dyagilevo-general-staff.html
https://charter97.org/en/news/2026/11/5/704446/'
  FROM airplanes a, wars w
 WHERE aw.id_airplane = a.id AND aw.id_wars = w.id AND a.name = 'Iliouchine Il-78 Midas' AND w.name = 'Invasion russe de l''Ukraine'
   AND (aw.side_id, aw.role, aw.role_en, aw.sources) IS DISTINCT FROM ((SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'russie'), 'Ravitailleur de l’aviation à long rayon d’action russe, basé notamment à Diaguilevo, qui « abrite des ravitailleurs soutenant les frappes de missiles » selon l’état-major ukrainien. Le 5 novembre 2026, un média ukrainien affirme qu’un Il-78 y a été endommagé par des drones.', 'Tanker of Russia’s long-range aviation, based notably at Dyagilevo, which "hosts aerial refuelling aircraft supporting missile strikes" according to the Ukrainian General Staff. On 5 November 2026 Ukrainian media claimed an Il-78 was damaged there by drones.', 'https://www.ukrinform.net/rubric-ato/4001358-ukrainian-forces-strike-russian-airfields-engels-and-dyagilevo-general-staff.html
https://charter97.org/en/news/2026/11/5/704446/');
UPDATE airplane_wars aw SET side_id = (SELECT s.id FROM war_sides s WHERE s.war_id = aw.id_wars AND s.side_key = 'russie'), role = 'Drone de combat russe de moyenne altitude, l’Orion réalise ses premières frappes vidéo en Ukraine dès avril 2022, notamment à Marioupol, puis retrouve un rôle à l’automne 2024 contre les forces ukrainiennes entrées dans la région de Koursk.', role_en = 'A Russian medium-altitude combat drone, the Orion carried out its first filmed strikes in Ukraine in April 2022, notably at Mariupol, then found a role again in autumn 2024 against Ukrainian forces in the Kursk region.', sources = 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kronshtadt_Orion
